的元素。X元素原子的最外电子层上的电子数,比次外电子层上的电子数少3个。Y元素原子的最外电子层上的电子数,是其电子层数的3倍。Z元素原子的L电子层上有4个电子。则X、Y、Z 3种原子的结构示意图分别为和______、______和______。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2506159, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 20}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "(1)放热<br> (2)气<br>\n提示:(1)降低温度,A的转化率增大,即反应向右进行,所以,正反应方向是放热反应。<br>\n(2)压强增大,平衡不移动,即反应式两边气体的物质的量应相等。已知A为气态物质,所以B和C都必须是气态物质才可。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2506160, "exerType": "章节题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "成考高起本物理化学模拟题四", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 5, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 5, "source": "化学章节题", "starCount": 0, "title": "可逆反应<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2021TKZT/A65.png' />达到平衡后,在其他条件不变的情况下:<br>(1)降低温度,A的转化率增大,则正反应是______反应(选填放热或吸热)。<br>(2)若A为气态物质,并且在压强增大时平衡不移动,则B物质一定是______态物质。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2506160, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 21}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "大于<br>\n提示:HCl、CH<sub>3</sub>COOH、Na<sub>2</sub>CO<sub>3</sub>的浓度和体积都相同,即它们的物质的量相同。混合时发生的反应为<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2021TKZT/A85.png' />\n<br>加热使CO<sub>2</sub>挥发,此时溶液中溶质为NaCl和 CH<sub>3</sub> COONa,后者水解使溶液呈碱性。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2506161, "exerType": "章节题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, 